WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.196
There's someone you've never properly thanked.

2
00:00:04.496 --> 00:00:08.815
Say it now, in your own voice. It doesn't have to be perfect.

3
00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:14.567
Seal it until their birthday, and send it by AirDrop or Messages.

4
00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:19.049
It waits on their phone, sealed, until the day.

5
00:00:20.349 --> 00:00:22.428
Then they hear it, from you.

6
00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:31.558
[Alex] Remember this table? That was the night you talked me out of quitting. I never really said thank you. So, thank you.

7
00:00:32.758 --> 00:00:36.533
They'll need Tell Anew to open it. No account, no server.
